   - Separated sBox operation from bulk key update for critical path reduction

4. **Dataflow Optimization:**  
   - Removed intermediate buffer copies through direct array accesses
   - Eliminated function call overhead by keeping all logic inlined

This version focuses on minimizing combinational path delays while maintaining strict sequential execution of rounds (required by key dependency). The array partitioning and full unrolling should enable single-cycle execution per round iteration when possible.
